{"lines":[{"t":"Reading","x":0.796008427229973,"y":0.098016028044890624,"w":0.078625736236572208,"h":0.014768928464927722,"c":1},{"y":0.14098837227990735,"w":0.72427983601888024,"h":0.01744185965530165,"t":"However, the number of trips being taken would probably increase, partly because","x":0.13580247237121815,"c":1},{"c":1,"w":0.62757202148437508,"t":"empty vehicles would have to be moved from one customer to the next.","x":0.13786007969568695,"y":0.15988372081038382,"h":0.013081395583944722},{"t":"Modelling work by the University of Michigan Transportation Research Institute","y":0.19186046497008047,"w":0.69341562906901044,"h":0.016031172025610885,"x":0.13580247343105412,"c":1},{"t":"suggests automated vehicles might reduce vehicle ownership by 43 percent, but","w":0.70987655639648439,"c":1,"h":0.01598837238037687,"y":0.20784883706007395,"x":0.13580246258179321},{"h":0.018261485442396364,"y":0.22345152254065503,"c":1,"x":0.13777615106166943,"t":"that vehicles' average annual mileage would double as a result. As a consequence,","w":0.73474522908528661},{"w":0.62757202148437496,"y":0.24263839811261301,"h":0.01472320376914027,"t":"each vehicle would be used more intensively, and might need replacing","c":1,"x":0.13580246653035849},{"x":0.1358024589979209,"y":0.25872093008615293,"h":0.016014052504504606,"w":0.67695475260416671,"t":"sooner. This faster rate of turnover may mean that vehicle production will not","c":1},{"x":0.13786008023330146,"t":"necessarily decrease.","w":0.19341564178466794,"c":1,"h":0.013081395583944722,"y":0.27616279054164594},{"y":0.3080094227818283,"x":0.13580248158063332,"w":0.69547322591145833,"t":"Automation may prompt other changes in vehicle manufacture. If we move to a","h":0.016195524146054185,"c":1},{"t":"model where consumers are tending not to own a single vehicle but to purchase","x":0.13366933069148559,"h":0.019258494652342528,"y":0.32336762660018803,"c":1,"w":0.70797190348307293},{"w":0.68312759399414069,"x":0.13580245817323003,"y":0.34156976727893706,"h":0.017441860778592888,"c":1,"t":"access to a range of vehicles through a mobility provider, drivers will have the"},{"t":"freedom to select one that best suits their needs for a particular journey, rather than","x":0.13580245866874491,"w":0.7345679219563801,"h":0.016048292108362672,"c":1,"y":0.35895170803300358},{"h":0.014723203769140158,"c":1,"t":"making a compromise across all their requirements.","x":0.13580245836111984,"y":0.37632508817886867,"w":0.45884775797526045},{"t":"Since, for most of the time, most of the seats in most cars are unoccupied, this may","x":0.13580246682767153,"h":0.017450420819968837,"w":0.7366255187988282,"y":0.40842167235738258,"c":1},{"w":0.71193415323893228,"y":0.42579505306649679,"c":1,"h":0.016195524146054185,"t":"boost production of a smaller, more efficient range of vehicles that suit the needs","x":0.13580247060124756},{"t":"of individuals. Specialised vehicles may then be available for exceptional journeys,","h":0.018919984078379248,"c":1,"y":0.44041198826559746,"x":0.13574781201250366,"w":0.73058283487955733},{"x":0.13580245993159348,"y":0.45930232543509741,"t":"such as going on a family camping trip or helping a son or daughter move to","h":0.01598837238037687,"c":1,"w":0.67078191121419273},{"c":1,"t":"university.","w":0.092592589060465497,"x":0.13580247133910878,"y":0.47529069789253287,"h":0.015988371257085521},{"w":0.6748971048990885,"y":0.50872093008635155,"x":0.13580247625090369,"t":"There are a number of hurdles to overcome in delivering automated vehicles","h":0.016014052504504606,"c":1},{"c":1,"h":0.01453488398216074,"w":0.69753087361653643,"y":0.5261627905648768,"t":"to our roads. These include the technical difficulties in ensuring that the vehicle","x":0.13374485115345883},{"h":0.016031172025610996,"x":0.13580247252572936,"y":0.5421083629984419,"t":"works reliably in the infinite range of traffic, weather and road situations it might","w":0.69958847045898431,"c":1},{"x":0.13573451939576539,"c":1,"t":"encounter; the regulatory challenges in understanding how liability and enforcement","h":0.01819925510419973,"y":0.55767152285488186,"w":0.74088429768880204},{"y":0.5755813952026777,"c":1,"h":0.015996932421752819,"w":0.67695475260416671,"t":"might change when drivers are no longer essential for vehicle operation; and","x":0.13580245898758003},{"t":"the societal changes that may be required for communities to trust and accept","x":0.13580248600571868,"y":0.59156976765997471,"h":0.015988371257085632,"c":1,"w":0.68930038452148445},{"x":0.13580246750757652,"t":"automated vehicles as being a valuable part of the mobility landscape.","y":0.6089517080299125,"w":0.62139918009440109,"c":1,"h":0.016048292108362783},{"t":"It's clear that there are many challenges that need to be addressed but, through","w":0.70576131184895829,"h":0.01598837238037687,"y":0.64244186031906725,"c":1,"x":0.13374485837715355},{"h":0.018361066901360856,"x":0.13369425252295608,"y":0.65817862574988406,"t":"robust and targeted research, these can most probably be conquered within the","c":1,"w":0.70587183634440109},{"c":1,"w":0.67283950805664061,"t":"next 10 years. Mobility will change in such potentially significant ways and in","x":0.13580246809874608,"h":0.016195524146054185,"y":0.67579505306611276},{"y":0.6899483161474812,"w":0.72651774088541665,"x":0.13571683428478271,"h":0.020300396760866479,"c":1,"t":"association with so many other technological developments, such as telepresence"},{"c":1,"x":0.13786007937109485,"h":0.01598837238037687,"w":0.68518519083658846,"t":"and virtual reality, that it is hard to make concrete predictions about the future.","y":0.70930232543502703},{"x":0.13780389527866399,"y":0.72508734462720448,"c":1,"w":0.68736216227213542,"h":0.017848549518203249,"t":"However, one thing is certain: change is coming, and the need to be flexible in"},{"h":0.016195524146054185,"w":0.71193415323893228,"t":"response to this will be vital for those involved in manufacturing the vehicles that","c":1,"x":0.13580247063292405,"y":0.74263839809936294},{"x":0.13547216823951524,"c":1,"y":0.75647214387515294,"w":0.23128420511881509,"h":0.02001657924045519,"t":"will deliver future mobility."},{"t":"21","y":0.91715116260773688,"w":0.024691357612609877,"c":1,"x":0.84979423878628757,"h":0.013081395583944722}],"h":3395,"w":2400}